<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Blogs on Mahmoud Adel — Security-minded Software Engineer</title><link>https://zrun.dev/blogs/</link><description>Recent content in Blogs on Mahmoud Adel — Security-minded Software Engineer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 10:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zrun.dev/blogs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Python CI/CD with GitHub Actions — Test, Build, Deploy</title><link>https://zrun.dev/blogs/github-actions-python-cicd/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zrun.dev/blogs/github-actions-python-cicd/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment (CI/CD) are essential practices in modern software development. In this guide, I&amp;rsquo;ll walk you through setting up a complete CI/CD pipeline for a Python project using GitHub Actions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="why-github-actions"&gt;Why GitHub Actions?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitHub Actions is a powerful, free (for public repositories) automation platform that integrates seamlessly with your GitHub workflow. Key benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native GitHub integration&lt;/strong&gt; — no external services needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Matrix builds&lt;/strong&gt; — test across multiple Python versions simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive marketplace&lt;/strong&gt; — pre-built actions for common tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free for open source&lt;/strong&gt; — generous free tier for public repos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="basic-workflow-structure"&gt;Basic Workflow Structure&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a &lt;code&gt;.github/workflows/ci.yml&lt;/code&gt; file in your repository:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker Compose for Reproducible Python Development</title><link>https://zrun.dev/blogs/docker-compose-development/</link><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zrun.dev/blogs/docker-compose-development/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker Compose simplifies multi-container application development by defining your entire stack in a single YAML file. In this guide, I&amp;rsquo;ll show you how to set up a development environment for a typical Python web application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="why-docker-compose-for-development"&gt;Why Docker Compose for Development?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reproducible environments&lt;/strong&gt; — &amp;ldquo;works on my machine&amp;rdquo; is no longer an excuse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Easy onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; — new team members run one command to start&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service isolation&lt;/strong&gt; — each component runs in its own container&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production parity&lt;/strong&gt; — development mirrors production setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="basic-project-structure"&gt;Basic Project Structure&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;myproject/
├── docker-compose.yml
├── docker-compose.override.yml # Development overrides
├── Dockerfile
├── app/
│ └── main.py
└── requirements.txt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id="docker-compose-configuration"&gt;Docker Compose Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="production-ready-base-docker-composeyml"&gt;Production-Ready Base (&lt;code&gt;docker-compose.yml&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;3.8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;web&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;8000:8000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@db:5432/myapp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;depends_on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;redis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;postgres:15-alpine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;POSTGRES_USER=user&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;POSTGRES_PASSWORD=pass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;POSTGRES_DB=myapp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;redis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;redis:7-alpine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;redis_data:/data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;postgres_data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;redis_data:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="development-overrides-docker-composeoverrideyml"&gt;Development Overrides (&lt;code&gt;docker-compose.override.yml&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;3.8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;web&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;./app:/app &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Hot reload&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;command&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;uvicorn main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;DEBUG=1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;5432:5432&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Expose for local access&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="multi-stage-dockerfile"&gt;Multi-Stage Dockerfile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-dockerfile" data-lang="dockerfile"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Base stage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;python:3.11-slim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;WORKDIR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;/app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;COPY&lt;/span&gt; requirements.txt .&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt; pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Development stage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt; pip install --no-cache-dir pytest pytest-cov ipdb&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;COPY&lt;/span&gt; . .&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Production stage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;COPY&lt;/span&gt; . .&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;CMD&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;gunicorn&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;main:app&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;-w&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;4&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;-k&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="common-commands"&gt;Common Commands&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Start all services&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose up -d
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# View logs&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose logs -f web
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Run tests inside container&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose &lt;span class="nb"&gt;exec&lt;/span&gt; web pytest
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Access database shell&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose &lt;span class="nb"&gt;exec&lt;/span&gt; db psql -U user -d myapp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Rebuild after Dockerfile changes&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose up -d --build
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Stop and remove containers&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose down
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Remove volumes too (clears data)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker-compose down -v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="development-tips"&gt;Development Tips&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="1-use-env-files"&gt;1. Use &lt;code&gt;.env&lt;/code&gt; Files&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# .env&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;POSTGRES_PASSWORD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;localdev123
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;DEBUG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reference in compose:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hardening a Linux Server — SSH, Firewall, and Beyond</title><link>https://zrun.dev/blogs/linux-server-security-basics/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zrun.dev/blogs/linux-server-security-basics/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Securing a Linux server is not optional — it&amp;rsquo;s essential. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re deploying a web application or managing infrastructure, these hardening steps will significantly reduce your attack surface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This guide is based on my experience in application security and Linux server administration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="1-ssh-hardening"&gt;1. SSH Hardening&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SSH is your primary access point — secure it first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="disable-root-login"&gt;Disable Root Login&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit &lt;code&gt;/etc/ssh/sshd_config&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;PermitRootLogin no&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="use-key-based-authentication"&gt;Use Key-Based Authentication&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Generate key pair on your local machine&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;your_email@example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Copy public key to server&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ssh-copy-id -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub user@server
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Disable password authentication&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;PasswordAuthentication no
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;PubkeyAuthentication yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="change-default-port"&gt;Change Default Port&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Port &lt;span class="m"&gt;2222&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Use any port above 1024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="limit-login-attempts"&gt;Limit Login Attempts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;MaxAuthTries &lt;span class="m"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;LoginGraceTime &lt;span class="m"&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Restart SSH after changes:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>